Hi Felipe:

Here's my counterexample with R 2.12.2 in a new R session:

library(reshape2)
df <- data.frame(gp = rep(LETTERS[1:3], each = 20), y1 = rnorm(60),
                  y2 = rnorm(60), y3 = rnorm(60))
dfm <- melt(df, id = 'gp', variable.name <http://variable.name> = 'a', value.name <http://value.name> = 'b')
head(dfm)
  gp  a           b
1  A y1 -0.77976037
2  A y1 -0.05497086
3  A y1  1.71569801
4  A y1  0.28717378
5  A y1 -0.65911808
6  A y1 -0.52379595

> sessionInfo()
